      "audit": "Only command.h/cpp, gpu.h/cpp, allocator.cpp and pipeline.cpp: preserve legacy APIs; external acquire uses producer layout and queue ownership, optional GPU semaphore wait and release. Android Vulkan device enables VK_KHR_external_semaphore_fd and its dependencies only when available; GpuInfo exposes support_VK_KHR_external_semaphore_fd. Concrete-format AHB images and views use queried VkFormat without external-format or YCbCr chains; nonzero external formats retain existing conversion. AHB import image remains sampled-only. Push-descriptor barriers use stack storage; delayed-record mode retains allocated barriers until submission. Conversion dispatch is unchanged."
    },
